§ `s 108 -- lost property`

#ASSERT NOT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet claimed on day 5`
#ASSERT NOT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet with a known owner not yet found on day 10`
#ASSERT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet nobody claims by day 30`
#ASSERT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet the owner claims on day 200`
#ASSERT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet the owner claims on day 400`
#ASSERT NOT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet claimed on day 29`
#ASSERT NOT `the property is unclaimed property` `a wallet claimed within the month and collected on day 45`

#ASSERT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet claimed on day 5`
#ASSERT NOT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet with a known owner not yet found on day 10`
#ASSERT NOT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet nobody claims by day 30`
#ASSERT NOT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet the owner claims on day 200`
#ASSERT NOT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet the owner claims on day 400`
#ASSERT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet claimed on day 29`
#ASSERT `the property must be returned to the owner` `a wallet claimed within the month and collected on day 45`

#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet claimed on day 5`
#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet with a known owner not yet found on day 10`
#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet nobody claims by day 30`
#ASSERT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet the owner claims on day 200`
#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet the owner claims on day 400`
#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet claimed on day 29`
#ASSERT NOT `the Commissioner may return or refund on a late claim` `a wallet claimed within the month and collected on day 45`

#ASSERT NOT `the finder has rights in the property` `a wallet nobody claims by day 30`

#ASSERT `the balance paid into the Consolidated Fund` 500 50 30 EQUALS 420
#ASSERT `the balance paid into the Consolidated Fund` 100 60 60 EQUALS 0

